<title>SWITZERLAND: Bobst 1996 slips, plans share repayment EMB.</title>
<headline>Bobst 1996 slips, plans share repayment EMB.</headline>
<dateline>LAUSANNE, Switzerland 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			67.8		vs 68.2</p>
<p> Div (bearer, Sfr)	    42		  vs 42</p>
<p> Div (regd, Sfr)		21		  vs 21</p>
<p> Turnover			 1,204	     vs 1,131</p>
<p> Cash flow			125.7	     vs 121.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Bobst AG said it was proposing to reduce the par value of its shares to allow the repayment of five Swiss francs per registered share and 10 francs per bearer share.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
